---
// src/pages/en/servicios/adultos.astro
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import imgConsulta1 from '../../../assets/Consulta1.jpeg';

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---

<BaseLayout
        title="Psychology for Adults | Natalia Mahana Palomer"
        lang="en"
        description="Individual psychological therapy for adults in English and Spanish. Online and in-person sessions in Berlin."
>
    <div class="container seccion-detalle">

        <header class="header-detalle">
            <h1>Psychology for adults</h1>
            <p class="lead">A space to understand yourself better, pause, and explore new ways of relating to yourself and others.</p>
        </header>

        <div class="grid-detalle">
            <div class="detalle-texto">
                <Image src={imgConsulta1} alt="Psychological consultation for adults" class="banner-img" />

                <p>Life does not always become difficult in obvious ways. You might be meeting your responsibilities and doing many of the things you expected to do, while still feeling that something needs care and attention.</p>
                <p>Perhaps you feel anxious, exhausted, or disconnected. You may be navigating transitions, relationship difficulties, or questions about who you are and how you want to live. In our sessions, we can explore these experiences from your own context, without judgment and without the need to arrive with a perfectly defined problem.</p>

                <h3>We can work around:</h3>
                <ul class="lista-items">
                    <li>
                        <svg class="item-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
                        <span>Anxiety, stress, and emotional overload.</span>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <svg class="item-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
                        <span>Difficulties regulating emotions and overwhelm.</span>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <svg class="item-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
                        <span>Life transitions and adaptation processes.</span>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <svg class="item-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
                        <span>Relationships and interpersonal conflicts.</span>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <svg class="item-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
                        <span>Self-esteem and your relationship with yourself.</span>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <svg class="item-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
                        <span>Identity, gender, and sexuality.</span>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <svg class="item-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
                        <span>Personal, family, or social expectations.</span>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <svg class="item-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
                        <span>Recurring patterns that cause distress or burnout.</span>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <svg class="item-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
                        <span>Migration, belonging, and intercultural experiences.</span>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <svg class="item-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
                        <span>Neurodivergence or exploring your own way of functioning.</span>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <svg class="item-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
                        <span>Understanding yourself better and living more connected to your needs.</span>
                    </li>
                </ul>

                <h3>In-Person Location in Berlin</h3>
                <p>In-person sessions at Spark: Markgrafendamm 20, 10245 Berlin.</p>
                <div class="mapa-wrapper">
                    <iframe
                            src="https://maps.google.com/maps?q=SPARK%20Collective,%20Markgrafendamm%2020,%20Berlin&t=&z=15&ie=UTF8&iwloc=&output=embed"
                            width="100%"
                            height="320"
                            style="border:0; border-radius: 12px;"
                            allowfullscreen=""
                            loading="lazy">
                    </iframe>
                </div>
            </div>

            <aside class="sidebar-precios">
                <div class="pricing-card">
                    <h3>Fees & Modalities</h3>
                    <p class="duracion-sesion">Session duration: 50 minutes</p>

                    <div class="precio-item">
                        <span class="modalidad">Online Session</span>
                        <span class="valor">80 €</span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="precio-item">
                        <span class="modalidad">In-Person Session (Spark)</span>
                        <span class="valor">100 €</span>
                    </div>

                    <p class="nota-social">Reduced-rate slots: Limited availability of sliding-scale spots for students and individuals with limited or variable income.</p>

                    <hr />

                    <h4>Public Health Insurance (Krankenkasse)</h4>
                    <p class="info-seguro">German statutory public health insurance (<em>gesetzliche Krankenkasse</em>) does not cover my sessions. For publicly covered care, you can refer to <a href="https://arztsuche.116117.de/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">KV Berlin (116117)</a>.</p>
                    <p class="info-seguro">Some private insurance providers may cover part or all of the costs.</p>

                    <a href={`${base}/en/#contacto`} class="btn btn-primary" style="width: 100%; margin-top: 15px;">Book a session</a>
                </div>
            </aside>
        </div>

    </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
    .seccion-detalle {
        padding-top: 130px;
        padding-bottom: 90px;
    }
    .header-detalle {
        text-align: center;
        max-width: 800px;
        margin: 0 auto 50px;
    }
    .lead {
        font-size: 1.2rem;
        color: var(--text-light);
        margin-top: 10px;
    }
    .grid-detalle {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 380px;
        gap: 50px;
        align-items: start;
    }
    .banner-img {
        width: 100%;
        height: 320px;
        object-fit: cover;
        border-radius: var(--radius);
        margin-bottom: 30px;
    }
    .detalle-texto h3 {
        margin-top: 45px;
        margin-bottom: 18px;
    }
    .lista-items {
        list-style: none;
        padding: 0;
        margin: 20px 0 35px;
    }
    .lista-items li {
        display: flex;
        align-items: flex-start;
        gap: 12px;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
        font-size: 1rem;
        color: var(--text-main);
        line-height: 1.55;
    }
    .item-icon {
        width: 18px;
        height: 18px;
        color: var(--primary-color);
        margin-top: 4px;
        flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .sidebar-precios {
        position: sticky;
        top: 100px;
    }
    .pricing-card {
        background: var(--bg-alt);
        border: 1px solid var(--lavender-soft);
        padding: 30px;
        border-radius: var(--radius);
        box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }
    .duracion-sesion {
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        color: var(--secondary-color);
        margin: 6px 0 16px;
    }
    .precio-item {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        padding: 12px 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--lavender-soft);
    }
    .precio-item .valor {
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: var(--secondary-color);
    }
    .nota-social, .info-seguro {
        font-size: 0.88rem;
        color: var(--text-light);
        margin-top: 15px;
        line-height: 1.5;
    }
    .mapa-wrapper {
        margin-top: 20px;
        border-radius: 12px;
        overflow: hidden;
        box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }
    @media (max-width: 850px) {
        .grid-detalle { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        .sidebar-precios { position: static; }
    }
</style>